  "title": "High-Protein Shakshuka with Eggs and White Beans",
  "description": "This high-protein shakshuka combines poached eggs, tender white beans, and tangy feta in a rich spiced tomato sauce. Packed with 30g of protein per serving, it comes together in just 30 minutes for an easy macro-friendly meal.",
